  "goodToKnow": "Einschlägig means relevant or pertinent, a favourite in job ads and academia: einschlägige Berufserfahrung, die einschlägige Literatur. It also means known in a certain (often shady) field: in einschlägigen Kreisen bekannt (known in the relevant circles), and einschlägig vorbestraft means having previous convictions for the same kind of offence. From einschlagen (to strike into, to take a direction)."
